// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Wade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3504684292" "Why, hello, {HeroName}. I assume you're here to arrest me, right? That's too bad for you.<br><br><color orange>After all of your experiences with super villains, you're able to tell that this isn't Darrin Wade. His posture is wrong and the image is slightly see-through.<br><br>Wade left you a decoy, most likely to buy himself some time. The tunnel behind the fake Wade is collapsed, meaning that he does <i>not</i> want you going that way.</color>"
// Page Intro SayOutLoudText :
"P176118816" "Why, hello, {HeroName}. I assume you're here to arrest me, right? That's too bad for you."
// Answer Text :
"P1167109680" "(Call Glacia)"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P3469547061" "<color orange>You call up Glacia and inform her of what you found, then ask for detailed plans on the tunnel system beneath Port Oakes.<br><br>Glacia informs you that she can get you that information in a few minutes.<br><br>The fake Wade continues talking, flinging various insults about your career as a hero and how useless/hopeless your efforts are.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2385719541" "(Leave)"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P3641449838" "<color orange>As you leave, you get a SOS from Back Alley Brawler!</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P1512067863" "(Help Brawler!)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Statesman 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P624195869" "<color orange>Statesman lies on the ground, his body completely still, his lifeless eyes staring past you. You're not sure why, but despite the immense amount of pain he must have been in, Statesman died with a small smile on his face.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P1595636493" "(Revive Statesman)"
// Answer Text :
"P2284044036" "(Close Statesman's eyes and leave)"
// Page Revive Text :
"P1874019704" "<color orange>You do everything in your power to bring Statesman back, but nothing seems to work.<br><br>Statesman is dead and gone, his spirit beyond your reach.</color>"
// Page CloseEyes Text :
"P3138086928" "<color orange>You close Statesman's eyes and step away from him. Wherever he is now, hopefully he can finally find the peace that he never had in his life as a hero.</color>"
// Page Leave Text :
"P4249975619" "<color orange>You step away from Statesman. You'll need to speak with Glacia and let her know what has happened. Statesman is dead, and Darrin Wade's plans continue.</color>"

