// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 0 Actor1 :
"P2954940439" "<goto Edge>"
// 6 Actor1 :
"P3045339051" "<t=6 d=6 bgcolor DimGray><color Silver><bgcolor DimGray>It looks like... You're -really- taking your daughter's death hard, Statesman!"
// 6 Actor2 :
"P478515512" "<em point t=6 d=6><bgcolor FireBrick><color white>There's nowhere left to run, Wade! You're going to pay for everything that you've done!"
// 5 Actor1 :
"P2399121147" "<t=5 d=5><color Silver><bgcolor DimGray>Oh? Are you going to kill me now, Statesman?"
// 6 Actor1 :
"P2548424708" "<goto Walk t=6 d=6><color Silver><bgcolor DimGray>Avenge the death of your daughter once and for all?"
// 0 Actor2 :
"P1007412702" "<goto Center>"
// 6 Actor2 :
"P930844128" "<t=6 d=6><bgcolor FireBrick><color white>No, Wade. You're going to -rot- in prison, and I'm going to make sure you do so until the day you -die-."
// 4 Actor2 :
"P2068753392" "<t=4 d=4><bgcolor FireBrick><color white>I don't kill."
// 4 Actor1 :
"P2153448021" "<t=4 d=4><color Silver><bgcolor DimGray>That's too bad, because I -do-."
// 1 Actor1 :
"P3237004953" "<em MaleStandToLevitate>"
// 0 Actor1 :
"P1559229745" "<goto Walk2>"
// 2 Actor2 :
"P25171451" "<em MaleReadytoReact t=2 d=2><bgcolor FireBrick><color white>AAAAAAAAGH!!"
// 6 Caption :
"P1975242515" "<x=0.5 y=0.2 t=6 d=6><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor DimGray>Do you feel that, Statesman? It's the same power that killed Imperious and Romulus."
// 6 Caption :
"P2336594027" "<x=0.5 y=0.2 t=6 d=6><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor DimGray>As we speak, your powers are being completely nullified. It should feel -quite- familiar."
// 0 Actor2 :
"P1454675974" "<em MaleReacttoOneKnee>"
// 4 Actor1 :
"P1126465873" "<t=4 d=4><color Silver><bgcolor DimGray>Do you have any last words, before you die?"
// 5 Actor2 :
"P3948920964" "<t=5 d=5><bgcolor FireBrick><color white>You'll never... succeed... Wade... villainy like yours... never... does...!"
// 4 Actor1 :
"P4069610998" "<t=4 d=4><color Silver><bgcolor DimGray>-That- was it? How trite. Goodbye, Statesman, I'll use your power well!"
// 1 Actor1 :
"P1063790798" "<em MaleStandToAbsorbCast>"
// 4 Actor2 :
"P576578653" "<em MaleOneKneetoFloat>"
// 1 Actor2 :
"P3009134674" "AAAAAAAAAGHHH!"
// 2 Caption :
"P1968262787" "<x=0.2 y=0.2 t=6 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Cornflowerblue>Grandpa, can you fly to Heaven?"
// 6 Caption :
"P749700225" "<x=0.7 y=0.2 t=6 d=6><scale 1.75><bgcolor FireBrick><color white>No, honey, you can only go to Heaven when you die."
// 6 Caption :
"P3518944618" "<x=0.2 y=0.2 t=6 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Cornflowerblue>... But if you can't die, how will you see me, mommy, and grandma after WE die?"
// 6 Caption :
"P1910966088" "<x=0.5 y=0.2 t=6 d=6><scale 1.75><bgcolor FireBrick><color white>You were so young back then... before you even thought about becoming Ms. Liberty..."
// 2.5 Caption :
"P3102117673" "<x=0.2 y=0.2 t=6 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor black>Marcus, hang in there! You will NOT die on my watch, do you understand?!"
// 6 Caption :
"P949687022" "<x=0.5 y=0.2 t=6 d=6><scale 1.75><bgcolor FireBrick><color white>Stefan... Recluse... You used to be my closest friend. I want to hate you, even in these last moments..."
// 2.5 Caption :
"P350487954" "<x=0.5 y=0.2 t=6 d=6><scale 1.75><bgcolor FireBrick><color white>But... I hope that Megan is right. That you -can- be saved in the end, just like I once was."
// 3 Caption :
"P1082283377" "<x=0.5 y=0.2 t=3 d=3><scale 1.75><bgcolor FireBrick><color white>Monica...?"
// 2.5 Caption :
"P1825849658" "<x=0.2 y=0.2 t=6 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor MediumOrchid>It's over, Marcus. We've all been waiting a long time for you to be with us again."
// 6 Caption :
"P3882500216" "<x=0.5 y=0.2 t=6 d=6><scale 1.75><bgcolor FireBrick><color white>But, Darrin Wade... someone needs to stop him. He's going to have my powers, and-"
// 6 Caption :
"P1155192691" "<x=0.2 y=0.2 t=6 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor MediumOrchid>The fate of the world never rested on one person's shoulders, Marcus. It's time for you to finally rest and see that."
// 6 Actor1 :
"P62405008" "<em MaleAbsorbToHover t=6 d=6><color Silver><bgcolor DimGray>I can feel it, your power flowing through me! Finally..."
// 6 Caption :
"P3726224794" "<x=0.7 y=0.2 t=6 d=6><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor DimGray>Soon, Statesman, I will bow to NO man, no authority, no GOD! YOU are just the first step!"
// 0 Actor2 :
"P2644932869" "<em MaleFloattoDeath>"
// 0 Actor1 :
"P423439265" "<em MaleHoverToStand>"
// 5 Actor1 :
"P2275353721" "<color Silver><bgcolor DimGray>After so many years of planning... Everything is nearly complete. Now, to tie up one last loose end before it's Psyche's turn..."
// Script Variable ACTOR_2_NAME :
"P108130695" "Statesman"
// Script Variable ACTOR_3_NAME :
"P534853849" "NAME"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P337629768" "Give me a hand here, {HeroName}, she won't go quietly!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3731237859" "Alright {HeroName}, we can clean this up if we kill Washington!"

