// Script Variable NPC_DIALOG_NAME :
"P2265270540" "Miss Liberty"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2409989984" "Now we fight"
// Script Variable NPC_DIALOG_NAME :
"P1410473990" "Stefan Richter"
// Script Variable NPC_DIALOG_NAME :
"P2808151008" "Lord Recluse"
// Script Variable NPC_DIALOG_NAME :
"P3904070179" "Monica Richter"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P457114751" "{HeroName}! I see you've found everything I left for you! Let's finish this, once and for all!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P1103228748" "Your efforts are pointless, {HeroName}! I have the power of Statesman, the power of Zeus!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1122299201" "Hrmph. I have things to do and heroes to kill. I have monsters that can kill the likes of you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Wade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2616304286" "Darrin Wade escaped!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2550004191" "Aspect of Ruladak"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P4035132623" "None"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P821288662" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGray>Witness just a mere fraction of Rularuu's power, {HeroName}! I give you an aspect of Ruladak the Ravager!<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGray>Luckily for you, I have not reached the point where I can summon the full force of Ruladak."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2364659917" "<t=6 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGray>Do you think I'm a monster, {HeroName}? I would try to explain myself further, but I'm sure we're beyond the point of civil discussion."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3705505941" "<t=6 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGray>Just understand, I have a plan to deal with Rularuu entering this world, and it WILL work. I'm not about to let him wipe out all of existence."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1261796792" "<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=8><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGray>Well, it looks like you're doing quite well against the aspect of Ruladak! It's a shame I didn't research how past versions of YOU were killed off."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2169617669" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGray>Hrmph. It doesn't matter. There are cogs that have been turning for years now, {HeroName}. <t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGray>You can't stop the inevitable from happening, but I certainly will have plenty more chances to throw you off of this mortal coil!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3068500442" "Statesman is dead, and Darrin Wade has vanished once more to continue his plot."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1968197025" "<color orange>You tell Glacia everything that happened at the temple in Cimerora. She stutters for several moments before speaking.</color><br><br>I... I don't believe it. How could... how could Statesman have been killed by someone like... <br><br>He fought in the Rikti War, {HeroName}! He stood toe to toe with Lord Recluse countless times! He saved the world more times than I can remember!<br><br>And now he's... he's just <i>gone</i>. No farewells... no speeches. What are we supposed to do now, {HeroName}? I know Statesman was only one person, but he was a symbol, {HeroName}. And now that symbol is gone.<br><br>I'm sorry, I've seen so much death and suffering on the Rikti homeworld, especially when they captured Hero 1. Maybe I was just hoping that things would stay constant here, unlike our time fighting in that place. I shouldn't be afraid, though. You said you fought Darrin Wade to the point where he was forced to retreat, right?<br><br>I'll be fine... I'm starting to come around now. Things look bad, downright <i>horrible</i>, but we can get through this because we're all in this together, and because we have <i>you</i>. There's clearly one person left that Darrin Wade is terrified of, and that's you, {HeroName}. Statesman is gone, but... we can still get through all of this, as long as we stick together. I'm going to work with the Phalanx on what to do next. Someone will contact you when the time is right, if you don't find Wade on your own, that is."
// RandomFameString :
"P1601848333" "I... I can't believe it. Statesman can't be dead, he can't!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
